### Create a new insurance with first policy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/policies/insurances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personalNumber": "199001011234",
  "address": "Kungsgatan 16",
  "postalCode": "11135",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01"
}

### Create another insurance
POST http://localhost:8080/api/policies/insurances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personalNumber": "198505055678",
  "address": "Storgatan 12",
  "postalCode": "11422",
  "startDate": "2023-06-01"
}

### Update policy (creates new version)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/policies/insurances/199001011234
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Vasagatan 20",
  "postalCode": "11120",
  "startDate": "2024-07-01"
}

### Get insurance by personal number
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policies/insurances/199001011234

### Get all insurances
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policies/insurances

### Get policies by personal number and date (should return policy v1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policies?personalNumber=199001011234&date=2024-03-15

### Get policies by personal number and date (should return policy v2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policies?personalNumber=199001011234&date=2024-08-01

### Get policy by insurance ID and date
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policies/by-insurance?insuranceId=1&date=2024-03-15
